  chi-k-runaway: LANDED 2026-07-10 (4797bc0). ChiKHyperprior::draw
    caps the sampled k at a 1e6 sentinel applied after the gamma
    draw, so runs below the cap are bit-identical (equivalence
    21/21 identical) and both runaway modes (chi(100, Inf)
    deterministic, few-tree df=1.5 stochastic) are bounded at a
    leaf sd that is statistically zero on the standardized
    response. State restore deliberately uncapped (draw() is the
    sole stochastic origin; reasoning in chi-k-runaway.md). The
    default-scale question stays with chi-default-research part 2.
