  tau-slice-stepout-cap: LANDED 2026-07-10 (7c1c7c9) - both
    step-out loops now carry Neal's m cap (10^4 expansions/side,
    an integer countdown short-circuiting ahead of the FP
    conditions, so bit-identity holds whenever the cap does not
